  "description": "<p><strong>UPDATE: Please see <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2559-sneaky-weasel-s-all-in-one-meds-food/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Sneaky Weasel’s All-In-One Meds &amp; Food</a> for unified version with medical item changes. You can enable different parts of the mod in the config file, so just turn off med changes if you prefer!</strong></p>\n<p>Changes food and drink to make them less arcadey, for those like me who are missing Realism…</p>\n<p>All items now deliver hydration/energy effects over time, rather than instantly.</p>\n<p>Many also have multiple uses to reduce litter on the playfield.</p>\n<p>Also see WeaselMedTweaks for similar over-time effects with medical items.</p>\n",
